<title>USA: Dixie Yarns names Glenn Berry CFO.</title>
<headline>Dixie Yarns names Glenn Berry CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dixie Yarns Inc said Wednesday that Glenn Berry has been appointed chief financial officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>The position had been vacant since Glen Grandin left in June, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Before joining Dixie, Berry was vice president and general manager of the components division at MagneTek Inc, where he was also chief financial officer of its Lighting Group, the company said.</p>
</text>
